[Script Info]ScriptType: v4.00+PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesWrapStyle: 0YCbCr Matrix: TV.709Title: Default Aegisub file[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Default,Arial,16,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,0,2,10,10,10,0Style: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Narrator-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: FlashbacksSecondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, CP9 is coming soon.Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.16,0:02:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, go on ahead and get on board.Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.99,0:02:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two! Hurry up and take her away!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.04,0:02:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.54,0:02:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Government officials, Marines... and Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.68,0:02:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright... How should I make my entrance?Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.85,0:02:42.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,None of you know the darkness I carry within me.Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.02,0:02:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's definitely being hauled in by the authorities.Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.44,0:02:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if she wanted to run, she could easily take out those chumps on her own.Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.07,0:02:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does she have some kind of agenda?Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.08,0:03:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or is there a reason she can't run?Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Robin my love!Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.38,0:03:11.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My darling prince, I knew you'd come!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.43,0:03:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could it be she's waiting for me to save her?Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Corgi, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP9 has arrived!Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.41,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,– You bastard! Let me go!Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.41,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,– Please let me go!Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.41,0:03:44.04,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are freaking me out!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Rob Lucci.Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.04,0:03:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a presence...Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.46,0:03:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's CP9...Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.34,0:03:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.63,0:03:54.55,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you're scaring me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.55,0:03:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me–Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you taking me?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.63,0:04:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys won't get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.43,0:04:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got 8,000 men under my comman–Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.19,0:04:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp...!Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great work on your long mission, agents!Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, sir, here's your coat.Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.11,0:04:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're going overboard.Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, all of you.Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir! R-Right away!Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look sharp!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on the train!Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on the sea train!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.51,0:04:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare to depart for Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.22,0:04:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said let me g–Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are they?Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case...Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.19,0:04:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Sorry I dragged you down till the end"?Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a pain even after leaving the crew.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little farther to the right!Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spray water there!Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.57,0:05:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pump more water!Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.16,0:05:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Robin doesn't hate us after all?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved!Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.37,0:05:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! He turned into a tanuki!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He turned into a tanuki!Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.75,0:05:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, he turned into a tanuki!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.96,0:05:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why we need to find Luffy and the others pronto to go save Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go find them!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.26,0:05:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are they?Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No clue! That's why we're looking for them!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha...Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my all!Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.35,0:05:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Now he's a gorilla!Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you go after Nico Robin,Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.44,0:05:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the sea train for government personnel will be departing at eleven o'clock.Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.83,0:05:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I had to guess, that's the train they're going to take.Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words...Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so will Nico Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.50,0:05:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Following its departure, the sea train will be suspended temporarilyDialogue: 50,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since Aqua Laguna is coming soon.Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then... that means...Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.01,0:06:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't sail out in this weather, so missing the train means you're stuck on this island.Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.52,0:06:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! This is bad! What time is it now?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 10:30.Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.35,0:06:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! We've only got thirty minutes left?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you do something?Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stall the sea train for a while!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.78,0:06:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... Its destination is Enies Lobby,  which is off-limits if you're not a government official.Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.24,0:06:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The engineer is a government agent, so he won't listen to me.Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.33,0:06:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Then...Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.71,0:06:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our only option is to head to the station and convince Robin in person...Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.55,0:06:40.21,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.71,0:06:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what directions Luffy and Zoro flew off to! Start looking there!Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.18,0:06:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you find them,  tell them to hurry to the station!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey... you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're okay, Mr. Paulie!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.77,0:06:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give this girl and her friend a hand.Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.73,0:07:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You want us to help them, Mr. Paulie?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.28,0:07:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But these people tried to kill Mr. Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.66,0:07:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should tie these two up instead!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lucci and Mr. Kaku are still missing–Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.04,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are not the assassins!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are innocent!Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.17,0:07:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real culprits tricked us into falsely accusing them!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.21,0:07:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no clue who those masked men were, but the Straw Hat Pirates fought them on our behalf!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.09,0:07:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, Mr. Iceburg  and I would probably be dead if not for them.Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.56,0:07:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't bother looking for Lucci or Kaku.Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.61,0:07:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might've seen the last of them.Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.36,0:07:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You know what happened to them?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.07,0:07:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They moved back home.Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! At a time like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget it! Go find Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Hussy!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That again? Quit calling me that!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're going to the station, right? Follow me.Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks...Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Paulie, hold on!Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is what you just told us true?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit your jabbering and make this right!Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna sully Galley-La's name?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– N-No, foreman! – N-No, foreman!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.31,0:08:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our apologies!Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.23,0:08:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We're sorry! – We're sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever you need, let us know!Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring the yagaras out! Open the cage!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.86,0:08:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They moved back home, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.45,0:08:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't need to know the details.Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.83,0:08:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough that they broke our trust, right?Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.89,0:08:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.77,0:09:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, come back!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please shout with me!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.40,0:09:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger! You guys got that?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, come back!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn into that canal!Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a shortcut to the station!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.98,0:09:43.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We still have twenty minutes left...Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.27,0:09:45.94,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't go, Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing yourself for us...Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As if we'd let that happen!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.44,0:09:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yagara! Please! Go faster!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.17,0:10:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The last departure at eleven o'clock...Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.46,0:10:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from Water Seven's  Blue Station to Enies Lobby...Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.89,0:10:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.89,0:10:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay here and be quiet.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.02,0:10:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Would it kill you morons to be more delicate?Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.27,0:10:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what he said! Morons!Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.65,0:10:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn government dogs!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey now...Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Due to the approaching storm surge,Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.69,0:10:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the schedule has been moved up and the train will be departing shortly.Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's leaving already?Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like our mission is almost complete.Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.25,0:10:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Refrain from making such frivolous comments until we arrive.Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fool.Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.13,0:10:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.59,0:11:00.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't sail out in this weather, so missing the train means you're stuck on this island.Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! Make it in time!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you safe?Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.55,0:11:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please come out!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.39,0:11:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.77,0:11:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! They're gonna take Robin away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.37,0:12:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Luffy and the others are doing...Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like no one will make it here in time.Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.17,0:12:17.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat. The last train will depart shortly.Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Those jerks!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.81,0:12:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck.Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I slipped at a time like this...!Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.91,0:12:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck.Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.17,0:12:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.80,0:13:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come out!Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta rescue Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.60,0:13:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Straw Hat! – Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Roronoa! – Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys?Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about this way?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.45,0:13:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap, no sign of them here.Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're in the Backstreets?Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.70,0:13:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That may be the case,  but the area might already be flooded.Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd be too dangerous to look there.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.46,0:13:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.01,0:13:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting too high, so we're departing a bit early.Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.77,0:13:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that an issue–Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.35,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depart.Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Well, then...Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've lived on this island for five years...Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.36,0:14:04.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I don't feel even a shred of regret leaving it behind.Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.92,0:14:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't that a steam whistle?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.59,0:14:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But it's strange. It's not the departure time yet.Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.27,0:14:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then again, there are no public passengers.Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.02,0:14:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather might be causing them to depart ahead of schedule!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.27,0:14:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! That's the station, straight ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.78,0:14:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please stop, sea train!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.91,0:14:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today's last departure from Water Seven to Enies Lobby...Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train's leaving. Be seated.Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.63,0:15:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is now departing.Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.93,0:15:09.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You made me live when I wanted to die.Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.97,0:15:12.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's your crime.Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.90,0:15:21.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to go and no home to return to.Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So let me stay on this ship.Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.07,0:15:28.53,FlashbacksSecondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Mellorine! Mellorine! Mellorine!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.44,0:15:27.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see... Then I guess we have no choice. Welcome aboard.Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,– Luffy! – Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.37,0:15:34.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,She's not a bad person.Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.76,0:15:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, I think we're moving.Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn government trash...!Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made it! Thank you, yagara!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down the stairs past that entrance!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.07,0:16:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! Don't go!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Who are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous! Stay back!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.21,0:16:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, get off the train!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who we're up against, we'll fight together!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.97,0:16:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't... get out...!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.78,0:16:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train...!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.00,0:17:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.59,0:17:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.91,0:17:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were too late...Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what was that guy thinking?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.01,0:17:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That train is for government use only.Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll catch him and that'll be that.Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.30,0:17:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Galley-La's... Paul–Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Read the room!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something is happening over there.Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.65,0:18:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Train stations are places of meetings and partings.Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.48,0:18:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As station employees, we should quietly watch over them, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.49,0:18:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.08,0:18:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quietly, got that?Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train left pretty early, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.59,0:18:28.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the passengers were on board, so–Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also...Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.76,0:18:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the sea was getting choppier than anticipated.Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.51,0:18:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The way things were headed, it looked like Aqua Laguna was about to arrive,Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we moved up the departure time.Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is dangerous, too.Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.73,0:18:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should evacuate to Shipyard Island soon.Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right...Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.94,0:18:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know... Once the train departs, there's no stopping it.Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The truth hurts...Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.86,0:18:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this Enies Lobby place is...Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, um... I understand how you feel, but–Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that train!Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's pissed!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those government morons! They won't get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, lend us a ship!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.05,0:19:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with you, all of a sudden?Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A big, strong ship!Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want to sail in this weather?Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.56,0:19:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be rash! You don't know how bad Aqua Laguna is!Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll manage!Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.27,0:19:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't just any storm! It's on another level!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.94,0:19:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea is about to get incredibly harsh!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.19,0:19:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you set sail now,Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're as good as dead!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.36,0:19:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if we don't, Robin is as good as dead!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.36,0:20:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was way too close...Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.57,0:20:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Mr. Paulie!Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.70,0:20:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We almost got dragged into the sea.Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.74,0:20:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that.Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The schedule board was torn apart by the force of that wave.Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.75,0:20:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing like this has ever happened before.Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.88,0:20:36.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with the power of this ebbing?Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only just now approaching, but...Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.34,0:20:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the speed and strength of this  Aqua Laguna's waves are abnormal.Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.31,0:20:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will the sea train carrying Robin be all right?Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.15,0:20:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It should make it through  the stormy area right before the surge hits.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.36,0:21:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it clears that, the train will make it through most of the big waves.Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.12,0:21:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, would you be Nami by any chance?Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.75,0:21:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An inconspicuous letter was left in the station plaza.Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From a friend, maybe?Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.58,0:21:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A letter? From whom?Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.71,0:21:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you found a small note.Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.05,0:21:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was over here! Hard to miss it!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That buffoon...!Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.14,0:21:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does it say?Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.89,0:21:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm... hold on a sec.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first half is just a pointless love letter, so...Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.65,0:21:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She said it's a love letter. The third man has appeared.Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.24,0:21:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judging from the situation, the third man is actually...Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.91,0:21:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's the important part.Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,P.S.Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw Robin board the eleven o'clock train,Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.96,0:22:01.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'll get on, too.Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.34,0:22:01.01,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.76,0:22:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji got on the train?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And... Usopp, too?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.60,0:22:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, a big thug with a pompadour...?Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.64,0:22:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be Franky.Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.19,0:22:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, there's no one else.Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.81,0:22:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fourth man...Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.56,0:22:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to think that the fifth man is Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.32,0:22:22.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor Mr. Paulie...Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.03,0:22:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd be better if he threw in the towel...Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with you guys?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.74,0:22:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um... also, this was with that letter.Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.50,0:22:38.67,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I should be able to find a transponder snail on the sea train.Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.67,0:22:40.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll touch base as soon as I can.Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.13,0:22:44.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I got this baby transponder snail in town.Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.51,0:22:46.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to always keep it with you.Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.55,0:22:47.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.55,0:22:50.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Think of it as your dear, beloved San–Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.56,0:22:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. So he'll call this one.Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.06,0:22:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then he foresaw where Nico Robin was going to be?Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.19,0:22:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.19,0:23:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the time being, at least Sanji's with Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.41,0:23:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find a way to Enies Lobby, too!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.67,0:23:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man...Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even have a smoke here.Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.05,0:23:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that right?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Sanji went to the station after that?Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.01,0:23:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.02,0:23:35.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,And Usopp is with them.Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.39,0:23:36.52,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief...Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But anyway, no matter how we follow the sea train,Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.98,0:23:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can't do anything until we find Luffy and Zoro.Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.23,0:23:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm certain which direction they flew.Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.45,0:23:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Search those areas!Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.45,0:23:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please help us out!Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.12,0:23:52.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.79,0:23:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.04,0:23:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.66,0:23:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.43,0:24:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, what's the best way to sneak in?Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.47,0:24:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What a crazy storm outside!Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.90,0:24:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Collier Shoot!Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.86,0:24:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.79,0:24:36.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it.Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.83,0:24:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.54,0:24:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't move!Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.50,0:24:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw his kick.Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.63,0:24:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's no ordinary civilian!Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.01,0:24:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, please...Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.60,0:24:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep complimenting me...Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.27,0:24:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll make me blush.Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.56,0:25:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a compliment!Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.15,0:25:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's mocking us!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.94,0:25:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Report to Agent Lucci that we have a suspicious intruder!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.07,0:25:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.41,0:25:16.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't something we need to bother CP9 with, is it?Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.87,0:25:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how violent the suspicious man is, there's no need to fear,Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.42,0:25:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because in this car–Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.63,0:25:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's smoky!Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.34,0:25:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you've got me!Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.42,0:25:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jerry, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.76,0:25:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the champion of a South Blue island that's famous for its karate.Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.77,0:25:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.69,0:25:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a boxing champion!Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.57,0:25:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a karate champion?Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.86,0:25:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save your jests until you've seen my punches.Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.99,0:25:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cruel!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.08,0:25:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jerry...Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.37,0:26:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aurora Flicker...Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.21,0:26:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jab!Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.58,0:26:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,J-Jerry, sir! Behind you!Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.80,0:26:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He escaped?Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.92,0:26:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid! Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.05,0:26:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just because I'm tall, you don't think this tiny car is a problem for me, do you?Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.35,0:26:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't say someone's ever warned me from between their legs...Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.68,0:26:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My boxing actually works better in narrow spaces!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.77,0:26:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try my yoga style!Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.23,0:26:27.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoga one, two!Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.61,0:26:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two!Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.82,0:26:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your reach shortened!Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.65,0:26:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just what I wanted you to think.Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.07,0:26:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw...Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.82,0:26:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drop Kick!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.16,0:26:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not even boxing anymore!Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.54,0:26:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a waste of time.Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.50,0:26:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brochette!Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.22,0:27:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the very back, the one leading the government officials in car seven is...Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.31,0:27:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They get stronger from there.Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.44,0:27:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one who leads forty Marines in car five is T-Bone,Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.40,0:27:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a Marine Headquarters' captain and a former knight.Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next up, in car four is Wanze,Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.58,0:27:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a martial artist from Cipher Pol No. 7 who is also the head steward on this trip.Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.91,0:27:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally, in car three we have Nero, the newest member of CP9.Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.93,0:27:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, though we are escorting criminals, there's no possibility of a raid.Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.94,0:27:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But just in case, we have military power ready in each car, so...Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.74,0:28:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.24,0:28:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.74,0:28:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're on your side!Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.04,0:28:06.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come out!Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.46,0:28:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, where are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.50,0:28:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foreman, it's hard to move, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.50,0:28:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a break, will you?Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.76,0:28:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot! This is nothing.Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.38,0:28:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and find those two!Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.88,0:28:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.05,0:28:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has someone told  Mr. Iceburg what's going on?Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.68,0:28:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two men went to report to him.Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.40,0:28:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.86,0:28:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg...Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.24,0:28:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.74,0:28:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.24,0:28:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer if you hear us!Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.16,0:28:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.83,0:28:47.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.00,0:28:53.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Food... you say?Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.00,0:28:54.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. We need meat!Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.96,0:28:58.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Lots of meat! Bring as much as you can get! Hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.38,0:29:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why are we being bossed around like this?Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.97,0:29:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, we're not doing it for her.Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.14,0:29:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doing this for Mr. Paulie, who's devoted to her even after getting dumped!Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.48,0:29:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.02,0:29:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, that girl must be really hungry.Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.57,0:29:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a growing girl, I bet!Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.54,0:29:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain...Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.37,0:29:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad.Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.96,0:29:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wind was already making  it hard enough to smell...Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.89,0:29:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, we've been yelling for a while, but we haven't heard a peep back.Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.81,0:29:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't think...Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.90,0:29:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't talk like that! Just do your best!Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.82,0:30:03.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys? Luffy... Zoro...Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.11,0:30:06.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That leopard guy couldn't  have taken you out, right?Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.33,0:30:12.33,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We finally know why Robin left us.Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.33,0:30:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.54,0:30:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer us!Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.34,0:30:25.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue you no matter what!Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.73,0:30:37.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.86,0:30:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Paulie! Look over here!Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.07,0:30:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The more the water ebbs,Dialogue: 50,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the bigger the returning wave becomes.Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.20,0:30:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you see how the tide ebbs, you can tell the scale of the storm surge.Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.63,0:30:58.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm being blown away!Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.59,0:31:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, if we try to see how much lower the water level goes this year...Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.59,0:31:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that, Chimney.Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.68,0:31:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's crazy!Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.57,0:31:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's as though the sea has dried up.Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.91,0:31:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Throughout my long life, I've never seen anything like this.Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.83,0:31:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can the tide ebb this much?Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.46,0:31:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen something like this before.Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.92,0:31:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how big is this next wave about to be?Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.34,0:31:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Backstreets are gonna be completely swallowed up.Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.43,0:31:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one left down there, right?Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.68,0:31:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope not, or they're fish food!Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.48,0:32:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The roar of the sea...Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.28,0:32:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stopped.Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.24,0:32:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.07,0:32:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Look, look!Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.99,0:32:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something over there!Dialogue: 50,0:32:14.50,0:32:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't say?Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.83,0:32:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something between two houses!Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.58,0:32:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look! Look! Look there!Dialogue: 50,0:32:24.30,0:32:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Kokoro!Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.13,0:32:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're that pirate girl.Dialogue: 50,0:32:29.72,0:32:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate lady!Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.22,0:32:32.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.81,0:32:34.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something over there!Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.18,0:32:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something over there?Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.52,0:32:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just what is it you're going on about, Chimney?Dialogue: 50,0:32:40.77,0:32:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on...!Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.52,0:32:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with this dried-up sea?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.29,0:32:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...!Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.33,0:32:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That straw hat...Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.96,0:33:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the next King of the Pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:33:02.96,0:33:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right?Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.26,0:33:08.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That imbecile...!Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.59,0:33:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Where are you going?!Dialogue: 50,0:33:12.85,0:33:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go down to the Backstreets!Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.31,0:33:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get yourself killed?!Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.52,0:33:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is already coming!Dialogue: 50,0:33:20.19,0:33:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!Dialogue: 50,0:33:24.77,0:33:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.86,0:33:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That pirate woman went down the stairs!Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.24,0:33:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come back!Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.90,0:33:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go down there!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:55.89,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Departing ShortlyDialogue: 1,0:01:50.13,0:01:55.89,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Departing ShortlyDialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:02.52,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Blue Station Entrance Shipyard IslandDialogue: 1,0:01:57.56,0:02:02.52,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Blue Station Entrance Shipyard IslandDialogue: 1,0:01:57.56,0:02:02.52,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Blue Station Entrance Shipyard IslandDialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:05:01.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruins of the Galley-La Company HQDialogue: 1,0:04:54.73,0:05:01.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruins of the Galley-La Company HQDialogue: 1,0:04:54.73,0:05:01.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruins of the Galley-La Company HQDialogue: 1,0:21:22.05,0:21:22.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.09,0:21:22.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.13,0:21:22.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.17,0:21:22.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.21,0:21:22.26,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.26,0:21:22.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.30,0:21:22.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.34,0:21:22.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.38,0:21:22.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.42,0:21:22.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.46,0:21:22.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.51,0:21:22.55,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.55,0:21:22.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, pleaseDialogue: 1,0:21:22.59,0:21:22.63,Caption